<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Help Center | ZimPlug Music</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            background: #050505;
            color: #fff;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        }

        a {
            color: inherit;
        }

        .help-page {
            min-height: 100vh;
            background: #050505;
        }

        .help-container {
            width: min(1120px, 92%);
            margin: auto;
            padding: 32px 0 100px;
        }

        /* =========================
           HEADER
        ========================= */

        .help-top {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 12px 0 25px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);
        }

        .help-logo {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .help-logo img {
            width: 105px;
            max-height: 60px;
            object-fit: contain;
        }

        .help-nav {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 28px;
        }

        .help-nav a {
            color: #777;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            transition: .2s ease;
        }

        .help-nav a:hover {
            color: #d4af37;
        }

        /* =========================
           HERO
        ========================= */

        .help-hero {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 820px;
            margin: 95px auto 85px;
        }

        .help-eyebrow {
            display: inline-block;
            color: #d4af37;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
        }

        .help-hero h1 {
            margin: 18px 0 22px;
            font-size: clamp(54px, 8vw, 92px);
            line-height: .9;
            letter-spacing: -5px;
        }

        .help-hero h1 span {
            color: #d4af37;
        }

        .help-hero p {
            max-width: 720px;
            margin: auto;
            color: #858585;
            font-size: 17px;
            line-height: 1.85;
        }

        /* =========================
           SEARCH
        ========================= */

        .help-search {
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: 35px auto 0;
            display: flex;
            background: #0b0b0b;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09);
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .help-search input {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 0;
            border: 0;
            outline: 0;
            background: transparent;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 18px 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .help-search input::placeholder {
            color: #555;
        }

        .help-search button {
            border: 0;
            background: #d4af37;
            color: #050505;
            padding: 0 25px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        /* =========================
           CONTENT SECTIONS
        ========================= */

        .help-section {
            padding-top: 55px;
            margin-top: 65px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);
        }

        .help-heading {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .help-heading span {
            color: #d4af37;
            font-size: 9px;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
        }

        .help-heading h2 {
            margin: 9px 0 0;
            font-size: 30px;
            letter-spacing: -.8px;
        }

        .help-heading p {
            max-width: 720px;
            color: #777;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        /* =========================
           CARDS
        ========================= */

        .help-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .help-card {
            padding: 28px;
            background: #0a0a0a;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);
            border-radius: 12px;
            transition:
                transform .2s ease,
                border-color .2s ease,
                background .2s ease;
        }

        .help-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            background: #0d0d0d;
            border-color: rgba(212,175,55,.35);
        }

        .help-icon {
            width: 42px;
            height: 42px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: rgba(212,175,55,.08);
            color: #d4af37;
            font-size: 17px;
        }

        .help-card h3 {
            margin: 0 0 11px;
            font-size: 17px;
        }

        .help-card p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #818181;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        /* =========================
           FAQ
        ========================= */

        .faq {
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);
        }

        .faq details {
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);
        }

        .faq summary {
            padding: 23px 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
            list-style: none;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .faq summary::-webkit-details-marker {
            display: none;
        }

        .faq summary::after {
            content: "+";
            float: right;
            color: #d4af37;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .faq details[open] summary::after {
            content: "−";
        }

        .faq-answer {
            max-width: 850px;
            padding: 0 5px 25px;
            color: #7e7e7e;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.85;
        }

        /* =========================
           TEXT
        ========================= */

        .help-text {
            max-width: 850px;
        }

        .help-text p {
            color: #858585;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.9;
            margin: 0 0 18px;
        }

        .help-list {
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }

        .help-list li {
            color: #858585;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 2;
        }

        /* =========================
           STEPS
        ========================= */

        .steps {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .step {
            padding: 25px;
            background: #0a0a0a;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .step-number {
            color: #d4af37;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .step h3 {
            margin: 15px 0 10px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .step p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #777;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.75;
        }

        /* =========================
           NOTICE
        ========================= */

        .help-notice {
            padding: 25px;
            background: #0a0a0a;
            border-left: 3px solid #d4af37;
            color: #858585;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.85;
        }

        .help-notice strong {
            color: #fff;
        }

        /* =========================
           BUTTONS
        ========================= */

        .help-buttons {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 25px;
        }

        .help-button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 13px 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            background: #d4af37;
            color: #050505;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            transition: .2s ease;
        }

        .help-button:hover {
            background: #e4c66f;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .help-button.secondary {
            background: #111;
            color: #aaa;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
        }

        .help-button.secondary:hover {
            color: #fff;
            background: #161616;
        }

        /* =========================
           CONTACT
        ========================= */

        .help-contact {
            padding: 40px;
            background:
                radial-gradient(
                    circle at 90% 10%,
                    rgba(212,175,55,.13),
                    transparent 38%
                ),
                #0a0a0a;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
            border-radius: 14px;
        }

        .help-contact h2 {
            margin: 0 0 12px;
            font-size: 28px;
        }

        .help-contact p {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0;
            color: #858585;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.85;
        }

        /* =========================
           FOOTER
        ========================= */

        .help-footer {
            padding-top: 55px;
            margin-top: 80px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .help-footer img {
            width: 95px;
            max-height: 55px;
            object-fit: contain;
        }

        .help-footer-brand {
            margin-top: 10px;
            color: #d4af37;
            font-size: 9px;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
        }

        .help-footer-links {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 25px;
        }

        .help-footer-links a {
            color: #666;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: .2s ease;
        }

        .help-footer-links a:hover {
            color: #d4af37;
        }

        .help-copy {
            margin-top: 25px;
            color: #3d3d3d;
            font-size: 10px;
        }

        /* =========================
           MOBILE
        ========================= */

        @media (max-width: 850px) {

            .help-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }

            .steps {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {

            .help-container {
                width: 90%;
                padding-top: 22px;
            }

            .help-nav {
                gap: 12px;
            }

            .help-nav a {
                font-size: 9px;
            }

            .help-hero {
                margin: 70px auto 65px;
            }

            .help-hero h1 {
                font-size: 55px;
                letter-spacing: -3px;
            }

            .help-hero p {
                font-size: 14px;
            }

            .help-grid,
            .steps {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .help-contact {
                padding: 27px;
            }

            .help-search button {
                padding: 0 16px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="help-page">

    <main class="help-container">

        <!-- =========================
             HEADER
        ========================== -->

        <header class="help-top">

            <a href="/" class="help-logo">
                <img
                    src="{{ url_for('static', filename='images/logo.PNG') }}"
                    alt="ZimPlug Music"
                >
            </a>

            <nav class="help-nav">
                <a href="/">HOME</a>
                <a href="/music">MUSIC</a>
                <a href="/news">NEWS</a>
            </nav>

        </header>


        <!-- =========================
             HERO
        ========================== -->

        <section class="help-hero">

            <span class="help-eyebrow">
                ZIMPLUG OFFICIAL
            </span>

            <h1>
                Help<span>.</span>
            </h1>

            <p>
                ZimPlug Music is built to make discovering and
                downloading music simple. Find new sounds, explore
                artists, discover trending releases and download
                available music directly to your device.
            </p>

            <div class="help-search">

                <input
                    id="helpSearch"
                    type="text"
                    placeholder="Search the Help Center..."
                    autocomplete="off"
                >

                <button type="button" onclick="searchHelp()">
                    SEARCH
                </button>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- =========================
             ABOUT
        ========================== -->

        <section class="help-section">

            <div class="help-heading">
                <span>ABOUT ZIMPLUG MUSIC</span>
                <h2>Music discovery, made simple.</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="help-text">

                <p>
                    ZimPlug Music is a music discovery platform focused
                    on making it easy for listeners to find, play and
                    download available music.
                </p>

                <p>
                    The platform brings music, artists, genres,
                    featured releases and trending songs together in
                    one simple experience.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Our goal is to keep music discovery clean,
                    straightforward and enjoyable while giving artists
                    and music creators another place to reach listeners.
                </p>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- =========================
             QUICK HELP
        ========================== -->

        <section class="help-section">

            <div class="help-heading">
                <span>QUICK HELP</span>
                <h2>What can you do?</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="help-grid">

                <div class="help-card">
                    <div class="help-icon">♪</div>
                    <h3>Discover Music</h3>
                    <p>
                        Explore new songs, featured releases,
                        trending music, artists and different genres.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="help-card">
                    <div class="help-icon">▶</div>
                    <h3>Play Music</h3>
                    <p>
                        Select a song and start listening using the
                        ZimPlug Music player.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="help-card">
                    <div class="help-icon">↓</div>
                    <h3>Download Music</h3>
                    <p>
                        When a release has downloads enabled, save
                        the music directly to your device.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="help-card">
                    <div class="help-icon">★</div>
                    <h3>Explore Artists</h3>
                    <p>
                        Discover artist profiles and explore music
                        associated with your favourite creators.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="help-card">
                    <div class="help-icon">#</div>
                    <h3>Explore Genres</h3>
                    <p>
                        Find music through genres such as AfroSounds,
                        Afrobeats, Hip Hop, Zimdancehall, R&B,
                        Amapiano, Gospel, Dance, Pop, Soul and Reggae.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="help-card">
                    <div class="help-icon">↗</div>
                    <h3>Find What's Trending</h3>
                    <p>
                        Discover music receiving attention through
                        plays, downloads and activity on the platform.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- =========================
             HOW IT WORKS
        ========================== -->

        <section class="help-section">

            <div class="help-heading">
                <span>HOW IT WORKS</span>
                <h2>From discovery to download.</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="steps">

                <div class="step">
                    <span class="step-number">01 — DISCOVER</span>
                    <h3>Find music</h3>
                    <p>
                        Browse the homepage, Music page, genres,
                        artists and featured releases.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="step">
                    <span class="step-number">02 — CHOOSE</span>
                    <h3>Select a track</h3>
                    <p>
                        Open a song or release and view the available
                        information and options.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="step">
                    <span class="step-number">03 — LISTEN</span>
                    <h3>Press play</h3>
                    <p>
                        Start the song and continue exploring music
                        while the player handles playback.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="step">
                    <span class="step-number">04 — DOWNLOAD</span>
                    <h3>Save the music</h3>
                    <p>
                        If downloading is enabled, download the music
                        directly to your device.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- =========================
             LISTENING
        ========================== -->

        <section class="help-section">

            <div class="help-heading">
                <span>LISTENING</span>
                <h2>Playing music on ZimPlug.</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="faq">

                <details>
                    <summary>How do I play a song?</summary>

                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        Find the song you want to hear and select its
                        play button. The ZimPlug Music player will begin
                        playback when the track is available.
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details>
                    <summary>Can I browse while music is playing?</summary>

                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        Yes. ZimPlug Music is designed so that listeners
                        can continue exploring the website while their
                        current music is playing.
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details>
                    <summary>How do I pause a song?</summary>

                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        Use the pause control in the music player.
                        Selecting play again resumes the current track.
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details>
                    <summary>Why did my music stop?</summary>

                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        Playback can be affected by your internet
                        connection, browser settings, the availability
                        of the audio file or another playback action.
                        Refreshing the page and trying the track again
                        may resolve temporary problems.
                    </div>
                </details>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- =========================
             DOWNLOADS
        ========================== -->

        <section class="help-section">

            <div class="help-heading">
                <span>DOWNLOADS</span>
                <h2>Downloading music.</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="help-text">

                <p>
                    ZimPlug Music supports direct downloads for releases
                    where downloading has been enabled.
                </p>

                <p>
                    When a download option is available, selecting it
                    allows your browser to download the music file to
                    your device.
                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="help-notice">

                <strong>Download availability:</strong>
                Not every song will necessarily have a download option.
                A release may be available for streaming without being
                available for download.

            </div>

            <div class="faq" style="margin-top:25px;">

                <details>
                    <summary>Where does my downloaded song go?</summary>

                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        The location depends on your device and browser.
                        Most browsers save downloaded files to your
                        device's Downloads folder unless you have selected
                        another location.
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details>
                    <summary>Why is a download not working?</summary>

                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        Check your internet connection and try again.
                        If the problem continues, report the song and
                        explain what happens when you select download.
                    </div>
                </details>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- =========================
             GENRES
        ========================== -->

        <section class="help-section">

            <div class="help-heading">
                <span>GENRES</span>
                <h2>Find your sound.</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="help-text">

                <p>
                    Genres help you quickly find music that matches
                    the sound you are looking for.
                </p>

                <ul class="help-list">
                    <li>AfroSounds</li>
                    <li>Afrobeats</li>
                    <li>Hip Hop</li>
                    <li>Zimdancehall</li>
                    <li>R&B</li>
                    <li>Amapiano</li>
                    <li>Gospel</li>
                    <li>Dance</li>
                    <li>Pop</li>
                    <li>Soul</li>
                    <li>Reggae</li>
                </ul>

                <p>
                    Genre availability and the music shown within each
                    genre may change as the platform grows.
                </p>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- =========================
             ARTISTS
        ========================== -->

        <section class="help-section">

            <div class="help-heading">
                <span>ARTISTS</span>
                <h2>Discover the people behind the music.</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="faq">

                <details>
                    <summary>What is an artist profile?</summary>

                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        An artist profile brings together information
                        about an artist and the music associated with
                        that artist on ZimPlug Music.
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details>
                    <summary>What information can an artist profile contain?</summary>

                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        Depending on the release and available
                        information, an artist profile can include an
                        artist name, biography, genre, location, artwork
                        and music releases.
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details>
                    <summary>Why can't I find an artist?</summary>

                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        The artist may not yet have a profile or release
                        available on ZimPlug Music. The platform will
                        continue to grow as more music becomes available.
                    </div>
                </details>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- =========================
             TRENDING
        ========================== -->

        <section class="help-section">

            <div class="help-heading">
                <span>TRENDING & PLAY COUNTS</span>
                <h2>What's getting attention?</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="help-text">

                <p>
                    ZimPlug Music can use activity such as plays and
                    downloads to help identify music that is receiving
                    attention on the platform.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Trending rankings may change as listener activity
                    changes. A song appearing in a trending section does
                    not necessarily mean it is permanently ranked there.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Play and download counts are intended to help
                    listeners discover music that is being actively
                    listened to or downloaded.
                </p>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- =========================
             ACCOUNT
        ========================== -->

        <section class="help-section">

            <div class="help-heading">
                <span>ACCOUNT</span>
                <h2>Your ZimPlug account.</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="faq">

                <details>
                    <summary>Do I need an account to listen to music?</summary>

                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        Many discovery and listening features can be
                        available without an account. Certain account
                        features may require registration.
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details>
                    <summary>What is my account used for?</summary>

                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        Your account can provide access to features that
                        require a signed-in user and may allow you to
                        manage your account information.
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details>
                    <summary>I cannot log in. What should I do?</summary>

                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        Check your email address and password and make
                        sure your internet connection is working. If
                        the problem continues, use the appropriate
                        support or reporting option.
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details>
                    <summary>How do I protect my account?</summary>

                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        Use a strong password and never share your
                        password or authentication information with
                        anyone.
                    </div>
                </details>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- =========================
             ARTIST / CREATOR RIGHTS
        ========================== -->

        <section class="help-section">

            <div class="help-heading">
                <span>ARTISTS & CREATORS</span>
                <h2>Music belongs to its creators.</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="help-text">

                <p>
                    Artists, labels, producers, publishers and other
                    rights holders may have rights in music, artwork,
                    names and other creative material.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Anyone submitting or distributing music through
                    ZimPlug Music should have the necessary rights,
                    permissions or authorization to do so.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Uploading content does not automatically transfer
                    ownership of that content to ZimPlug Music.
                </p>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- =========================
             COPYRIGHT
        ========================== -->

        <section class="help-section">

            <div class="help-heading">
                <span>COPYRIGHT & DMCA</span>
                <h2>Respect the rights behind every release.</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="help-text">

                <p>
                    ZimPlug Music respects copyright and other
                    intellectual property rights.
                </p>

                <p>
                    If you believe that music, artwork or another
                    piece of content on the platform infringes your
                    rights, please provide the relevant information
                    through the Legal & DMCA process.
                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="help-buttons">

                <a href="/legal" class="help-button">
                    LEGAL & DMCA →
                </a>

                <a href="/report" class="help-button secondary">
                    REPORT CONTENT →
                </a>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- =========================
             REPORTING
        ========================== -->

        <section class="help-section">

